    {
      "id": "clangd-import-std-order-20261029",
      "type": "PROCEDURE",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-29T13:12:33Z",
      "project": "Parametric-Feature-Based-Modeling",
      "tags": [
        "clangd",
        "cpp23",
        "import-std",
        "libstdc++",
        "testing"
      ],
      "content": "Clang/clangd 22.1.8与libstdc++16：先包含标准库/第三方头文件再import std可能令clangd报std::__format::_Sink_iter定义冲突，而编译通过。将import std放在实现文件开头、早于所有include，可消除此诊断，保持原生clangd和同一编译数据库，不屏蔽诊断。",
      "file": ".memory/procedures/clangd-import-std-order.md"
    },
